    "type": "question",
    "label": "6",
    "prompt": "The distance from Adelaide to Uluru is $1550\\text{ km}$, and the distance from Adelaide to Darwin via Uluru is $3050\\text{ km}$. How far is Uluru from Darwin?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$1500\\text{ km}$",
      "worked": "Subtract the Adelaide–Uluru distance from the total distance via Uluru.\n\n$$\\begin{array}{r}3050\\\\-1550\\\\\\hline1500\\end{array}$$\n\nTrade one thousand for ten hundreds: $10-5=5$ hundreds and $2-1=1$ thousand. Uluru is $1500\\text{ km}$ from Darwin.",
